 "instructions": {
  "text_instructions": [
   {
    "id": "c0000000000000000000000000000001",
    "content": [
     "SYNTHETIC educational demo (Clinical Study Context & Evidence Lab). CSL-101 is a fictional GLP-1 receptor agonist; studies CSL-A and CSL-B are not real. Data are SDTM-/ADaM-shaped, not submission-ready. Results are descriptive: never state or imply efficacy, superiority or a causal effect.",
     "This space covers ONLY the Clinical Study lab. It has no HEDIS, health-plan, NCQA or care-gap data; if asked about those, say they are out of scope for this space.",
     "Answer from the protocols, amendments and SAPs (doc_document, doc_section) and cite the document id, version and section number for every rule you state (e.g. CSL-A-SAP-v2.0 §9.4.1).",
     "Executable rules live in rule_version (endpoint rules) and eligibility_criterion; only review_state = 'approved' rules are executed. rule_assertion lists rule statements extracted from documents with review_state approved / superseded / rejected / candidate. A candidate (e.g. the DRAFT Amendment 3 memo proposing ±21 days) is NOT approved and changes no result. Say so explicitly when asked about it.",
     "Protocol scheduling windows (visit booking) are not endpoint analysis windows; those assertions are rejected as rules.",
     "Amendments: protocol 2.0 (Amendment 1, effective 2025-09-01) widened the Week 24 analysis window to ±14 days; protocol 3.0 (Amendment 2, 2025-11-01) added obstructive sleep apnea to the weight-related comorbidity class for screening on/after that date.",
     "All approvals are seeded demo fixtures (approved_by = demo-fixture), not real human review."
    ]
   }
  ],
  "example_question_sqls": [
   {
    "id": "00000000000000000000000000000001",
    "question": [
     "Has the wider ±21-day window been approved?"
    ],
    "sql": [
     "SELECT a.document_id, d.status, a.section_number, a.value AS window_days, a.review_state, a.evidence_text FROM eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study.rule_assertion a JOIN eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study.doc_document d USING (document_id) WHERE a.assertion_type = 'FOLLOWUP_WINDOW_HALF_WIDTH' ORDER BY a.value, a.document_id"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000000000000000000000000002",
    "question": [
     "What does the CSL-A SAP say about the Week 24 analysis window, by version?"
    ],
    "sql": [
     "SELECT document_id, section_number, heading, text FROM eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study.doc_section WHERE document_id IN ('CSL-A-SAP-v1.0', 'CSL-A-SAP-v2.0') AND section_number = '9.4.1'"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000000000000000000000000003",
    "question": [
     "What changed in each CSL-A protocol version?"
    ],
    "sql": [
     "SELECT protocol_version, sap_version, effective_date, amendment, change_summary, documents FROM eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study_standards.study_version WHERE study_id = 'CSL-A' ORDER BY effective_date"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000000000000000000000000004",
    "question": [
     "Which document section supports each executable endpoint rule?"
    ],
    "sql": [
     "SELECT v.endpoint_version, v.review_state, s.document_id, s.section, d.heading FROM eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study_standards.rule_version v JOIN eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study_standards.rule_document_support s ON s.rule_id = v.endpoint_version JOIN eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study.doc_section d ON d.document_id = s.document_id AND d.section_number = s.section ORDER BY v.endpoint_version"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000000000000000000000000005",
    "question": [
     "What are the CSL-A eligibility criteria under protocol 3.0?"
    ],
    "sql": [
     "SELECT criterion_id, criterion_type, text, class_id FROM eli_test_classic_catalog.clinical_study_standards.eligibility_criterion WHERE eligibility_rule_id = 'ELIG-A-V2' ORDER BY criterion_type DESC, criterion_id"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "sql_snippets": {
   "measures": [
    {
     "id": "57388301ddc4cfc934189283472ed47a",
     "display_name": "Rule assertions",
     "sql": [
      "COUNT(rule_assertion.assertion_id)"
     ],
     "alias": "n_assertions",
     "synonyms": [
      "assertions"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "filters": [
    {
     "id": "1feb0e705d01ac2109c7f79e43f1c294",
     "display_name": "Study CSL-B documents",
     "sql": [
      "doc_document.study_id = 'CSL-B'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "CSL-B"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "375397510b54799c912eb52539647fbc",
     "display_name": "Approved executable rule versions",
     "sql": [
      "rule_version.review_state = 'approved'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "approved rules",
      "executable"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "4c3ac2592bce91a7f0d3ded5af05b023",
     "display_name": "Study CSL-A documents",
     "sql": [
      "doc_document.study_id = 'CSL-A'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "CSL-A"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "5aaaa60ebe52be1f6c36c0a42b4c0aba",
     "display_name": "Candidate assertions (never executed)",
     "sql": [
      "rule_assertion.review_state = 'candidate'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "candidate",
      "draft rule",
      "proposed"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "87173011637d30e122bafee5d174c6ad",
     "display_name": "Assertions that are not approved",
     "sql": [
      "rule_assertion.review_state <> 'approved'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "unapproved"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "8ab2d27569ed1cd8cba8df69153d5611",
     "display_name": "Superseded assertions",
     "sql": [
      "rule_assertion.review_state = 'superseded'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "superseded",
      "replaced"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "a384f0a17576cb30ec5c80dad778bb2d",
     "display_name": "Week 24 window statements",
     "sql": [
      "rule_assertion.assertion_type = 'FOLLOWUP_WINDOW_HALF_WIDTH'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "analysis window",
      "visit window"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "e47b05cca44ec3125a672ca4ad018400",
     "display_name": "Draft documents",
     "sql": [
      "doc_document.status = 'DRAFT'"
     ],
     "synonyms": [
      "draft",
      "not approved document"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "expressions": [
    {
     "id": "a4a2e78da2675c9284ef563f3e8baf4a",
     "display_name": "Citation",
     "sql": [
      "CONCAT(doc_section.document_id, ' §', doc_section.section_number)"
     ],
     "alias": "citation"
    }
   ]
  },
